{"role":"assistant","message":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"No — the opposite. Adding someone to the organization gives them access to every project in that org.\n\nAccess comes from either:\n1. **Org membership** — their org role applies to all org projects\n2. **Direct project membership** — optional; if present, that project role wins over the org role\n\nSo you don’t need to add them to each project for basic access. Project team membership is for per-project role overrides (and is what the Project → Team list shows; org-only members won’t appear there even though they can use the project)."}]}}
